        "execSummary":  "The productivity gains from agentic AI are real but insufficient on their own ΓÇö the C-suite metric that matters is business impact, and that number is declining even as deployment accelerates. The 23% reportable-impact figure is a critical benchmark: it means three out of four companies deploying agentic AI cannot yet demonstrate board-level ROI. For customer-support and operations leaders, this data argues for concentrating agentic AI on a small number of high-volume, high-measurability use cases ΓÇö deflection rate, handle time, CSAT ΓÇö rather than broad rollout. Diffuse deployment without measurable outcome definitions is the pattern driving the impact gap.",
